SUMMARY:North Shore Center Presents: Capitol Fools
DESCRIPTION:What happens when Washington\, D.C.’s premiere\, political satire group – The Capitol Steps – call it quits after nearly 40 years?  Most folks would agree that it was a great run\, and the story would end there. \nBut an intrepid group of cast members and a co-writer would not go quietly into that good night. This band of fools reflected on a world without musical\, political satire\, and didn’t like what they saw.  And just like that The Capitol Fools were born. \nWhile foolish enough to embark on this new journey\, they were smart enough to not reinvent the wheel.  Fast-paced\, laugh out loud show…check.  Equal opportunity offenders…check.  Skewering both sides of the aisle…check.  If a “Steps-style show” is wrong\, they don’t want to be right. \nThe Capitol Fools hold up a mirror to our crazy political culture\, providing hilarious song parodies and foolish reflections that inspire belly-laughter as both sides of the aisle get skewered. Cast members from past seasons of the Capitol Steps perform all the beloved bits\, the mind-boggling backward talking spoonerisms\, break-neck costume changes\, over-the-top impressions\, and song parodies reflecting the day’s news. \nThe spirit\, irreverence and D.N.A. of The Capitol Steps lives on with The Capitol Fools!
URL:https://northshorecenter.org/event/capitolfools2026/2026-04-25/1/
LOCATION:George Van Dusen Theatre
CATEGORIES:Comedy,North Shore Center Presents
END:VEVENT
